ForVar      = "(" ForVarList ")" | ForPathAhead Target <~~ push({ftarget: pop()}) ~~>
            | "@@" Id <~~ push({fvar: "@@" + up.in}) ~~>
            | "@" Id <~~ push({fvar: "@" + up.in}) ~~> | "$" Id <~~ push({fvar: "$" + up.in}) ~~>
